{"book":"kinney","chapter":"tailwind","chapterTitle":"Tailwind CSS","slug":"data-attribute-variants","title":"صيغ خصائص البيانات","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام-الأساسي","text":"الاستخدام الأساسي"},{"depth":3,"id":"فحص-الوجود-مبسط-في-v4","text":"فحص الوجود (مبسّط في v4)"},{"depth":3,"id":"فحص-القيمة","text":"فحص القيمة"},{"depth":2,"id":"مع-group-وpeer","text":"مع Group وPeer"},{"depth":2,"id":"اختصارات-مخصصة","text":"اختصارات مخصصة"},{"depth":2,"id":"أنماط-شائعة","text":"أنماط شائعة"},{"depth":3,"id":"واجهات-التبويبات","text":"واجهات التبويبات"},{"depth":3,"id":"عناصر-الأكورديون","text":"عناصر الأكورديون"},{"depth":3,"id":"التحقق-من-النماذج","text":"التحقق من النماذج"},{"depth":2,"id":"أفضل-الممارسات","text":"أفضل الممارسات"}],"html":"<p>نسّق العناصر بناءً على خصائص بياناتها — مثالي للحالة التي تديرها أطر JavaScript.</p>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام-الأساسي\">الاستخدام الأساسي <span class=\"content-anchor\" id=\"basic-usage\"></span></h2>\n<h3 id=\"فحص-الوجود-مبسط-في-v4\">فحص الوجود (مبسّط في v4)</h3>\n<p><em>فحص الوجود (مبسّط في v4) — المثال 1 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/f0d1f5e83346cd30a29c2fe02dc5a5bef61a5431b906f6fe6940eb4932564769.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Styles apply when data-active exists --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-active</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;opacity-50 data-active:opacity-100&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Active content<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Common boolean attributes --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-current</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;data-current:font-bold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Current item<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-loading</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;data-loading:animate-pulse&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Submit<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"فحص-القيمة\">فحص القيمة</h3>\n<p><em>فحص القيمة — المثال 2 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/80f892658d07ce659bb4989f33f1975c88304f48831d190196991bbd16e4cb3a.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Styles apply when attribute has specific value --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-theme</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dark&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;bg-white data-[theme=dark]:bg-gray-900&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Theme-aware container<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-state</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;expanded&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;h-12 data-[state=expanded]:h-auto&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Expandable content<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"مع-group-وpeer\">مع Group وPeer</h2>\n<p><em>مع Group وPeer — المثال 3 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/8bc6bcda79272a0b9d855bbed5555b28f96be7a491280e31fc81f70956ac0391.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Style based on parent&#x27;s data attribute --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-status</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group-data-[status=error]:border-red-500&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hidden group-data-[status=error]:block&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Error!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Style based on sibling&#x27;s data attribute --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-visible</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Toggle<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hidden peer-data-visible:block&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Shown when sibling has data-visible<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"اختصارات-مخصصة\">اختصارات مخصصة</h2>\n<p>عرّف صيغ خصائص بيانات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام في CSS:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@import</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;tailwindcss&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@theme</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">--data-state-active</span>: [data-state= <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;active&#x27;</span>];\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">--data-state-loading</span>: [data-state= <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;loading&#x27;</span>];\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">--data-orientation-vertical</span>: [data-orientation= <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vertical&#x27;</span>];\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>ثم استخدمها:</p>\n<p><em>اختصارات مخصصة — المثال 4 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/b62f519d10cd02d8e9eb57a11e0e6629465a05de6e5441faa6d972c3624242fc.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-state</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;loading&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;data-state-loading:opacity-50&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Save<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"أنماط-شائعة\">أنماط شائعة</h2>\n<h3 id=\"واجهات-التبويبات\">واجهات التبويبات</h3>\n<p><em>واجهات التبويبات — المثال 5 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/f9beb25beff28a28ba9808b5a079d447699d3eb96e66f7646fd2c8f6851bac6b.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-selected</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;data-selected:border-b-2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Tab 1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"عناصر-الأكورديون\">عناصر الأكورديون</h3>\n<p><em>عناصر الأكورديون — المثال 6 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/616bba8200728c767651487f6d4ed971fe6a242fcf07377c2e610f4b8dfecbc0.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-expanded</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;data-expanded:pb-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Content<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"التحقق-من-النماذج\">التحقق من النماذج</h3>\n<p><em>التحقق من النماذج — المثال 7 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/68f3eecffa8e1ecdcb42b7ab7d4fa7d03cc53603e5a9e18ce6bc82585212549f.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-invalid</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;data-invalid:ring-red-500&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"أفضل-الممارسات\">أفضل الممارسات <span class=\"content-anchor\" id=\"best-practices\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>استخدم خصائص البيانات للحالة التي يديرها JavaScript</li>\n<li>أبقِ أسماء الخصائص دلالية ومتسقة</li>\n<li>عرّف صيغًا مخصصة للأنماط كثيرة الاستخدام</li>\n<li>تذكّر: يحتاج Tailwind إلى أسماء أصناف كاملة في ملفات المصدر</li>\n</ul>\n"}